e described as fund return plus a top-up return (u8).","source_unit_ids":["u8","u13","u14"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"exceptions","explanation":"The express exception is “a discount of fees or charges” (u14). The text does not resolve whether mixed benefits are partly exempt or whether every component must qualify as a fee/charge discount; the proposed control treats any non-discount component as outside the exception.","source_unit_ids":["u14"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"modality","explanation":"“Should not offer” in u14 and u15 states a normative control. Section 103 consequences are stated as an offence unless authorization or an exemption applies (u10), but the controlling statutory and Code texts are not supplied.","source_unit_ids":["u10","u14","u15"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"time","explanation":"No operative date, transition period, or retrospective rule is stated in the retained units. Unit u30 dates an FAQ to 30 September 2010, but that date identifies the FAQ rather than the control’s effective date.","source_unit_ids":["u24","u30","u31"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"Applying section 103, paragraph 3.11, paragraph 2.3, and advertising-guideline requirements requires the missing external authorities identified in the diagnostic. The circular’s own descriptions support a provisional reading only.","source_unit_ids":["u7","u10","u12","u21","u22","u29","u30","u31"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}],"questions":["Does the complete text of Code of Conduct paragraph 3.11 define actor or product scope more narrowly than the quotation in u14?","Does the fee/charge discount exception apply to a mixed package containing both discounts and non-discount benefits?","What effective dates and amendments govern section 103, paragraph 3.11, paragraph 2.3, and the cited advertising guidelines?","Does the statutory authorization or exemption in section 103 apply to the described distributor arrangement?"],"readings":[{"assumptions":["The assessment concerns one identified offer or proposed offer to a client.","Gift classification, product linkage, and distributor status are supplied professional judgments.","The result tests only the selected paragraph-3.11 gift control."],"citations":[{"quote":"Intermediaries who distribute these funds (distributors)","unit_id":"u1"},{"quote":"distributors should not offer any gifts (other than a discount of fees or charges) in promoting a specific investment product or a particular type of investment product to a client.","unit_id":"u14"},{"quote":"If gifts are offered in such a way that they are linked to a particular type of investment product","unit_id":"u14"}],"distinction":"Reading A treats the quoted paragraph-3.11 wording as product-wide for the identified distributors, while retaining uncertainty about whether the circular’s surrounding context narrows it to SFC-authorised funds.","family":"exceptions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor is an intermediary distributing SFC-authorised funds within the circular’s distributor category.","name":"is_distributor","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u1"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed activity promotes a specific investment product or particular investment-product type to a client.","name":"has_product_promotion_link","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed offer includes a benefit classified as a gift.","name":"offers_gift","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u13","u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Every gift component in the assessed offer qualifies as a discount of fees or charges.","name":"all_gifts_are_fee_discounts","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(or (not offers_gift) all_gifts_are_fee_discounts)","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_distributor has_product_promotion_link)"},"local_id":"r1","questions":["Does the complete paragraph 3.11 support this product-wide scope?"],"statement":"Under a product-wide reading, a linked gift fails the selected control unless all gift components are fee or charge discounts.","subject":"Paragraph-3.11 gift control with product-wide scope"},{"assumptions":["The circular’s repeated references to SFC-authorised funds define the operative product scope.","Gift classification and linkage are supplied professional judgments.","The result tests only the selected paragraph-3.11 gift control."],"citations":[{"quote":"in offering such returns or other incentives in promoting SFC-authorised funds","unit_id":"u13"},{"quote":"when offering or promoting funds, distributors should not offer additional returns ... or other incentives","unit_id":"u15"},{"quote":"If gifts are offered in such a way that they are linked to a particular type of investment product","unit_id":"u14"}],"distinction":"Reading B confines the selected control to promotions of SFC-authorised funds because that is the circular’s stated subject and the direct application in u13 and u15. The broader phrase in u14 may explain the rule’s rationale without independently expanding this circular’s scope.","family":"scope","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor is an intermediary distributing SFC-authorised funds within the circular’s distributor category.","name":"is_distributor","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u1"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed promotion concerns SFC-authorised funds.","name":"promotes_authorised_funds","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u1","u13","u15"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed activity promotes a specific fund or fund type to a client and the benefit is linked to that promotion.","name":"has_product_promotion_link","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed offer includes a benefit classified as a gift.","name":"offers_gift","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u13","u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Every gift component in the assessed offer qualifies as a discount of fees or charges.","name":"all_gifts_are_fee_discounts","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(or (not offers_gift) all_gifts_are_fee_discounts)","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_distributor promotes_authorised_funds has_product_promotion_link)"},"local_id":"r2","questions":["Does the phrase “specific investment product” in u14 independently extend the control beyond SFC-authorised funds?","Are other incentives in u15 governed by the same fee-discount exception or by separate requirements?"],"statement":"Under a fund-specific reading, the selected control applies when a distributor promotes SFC-authorised funds and offers a linked gift; the fee/charge discount is the stated exception.","subject":"Paragraph-3.11 gift control confined to SFC-authorised-fund promotions"}]},"method":"Investigate the selected parent using the requested move, uncited source units and supplied counterexamples. Retain justified rival readings and explain any failed hypothesis.","move":"exception-attachment","parent":{"assumptions":["The assessment concerns one identified offer or proposed offer to a client.","The circular’s defined distributor category supplies actor scope, but the quoted investment-product wording supplies product scope.","The Boolean result is a selected paragraph-10 gift-control pass only when scope is true; it does not establish overall compliance.","Gift classification and promotional linkage are supplied judgments, not inferred truth values."],"citations":[{"quote":"Intermediaries who distribute these funds (distributors)","unit_id":"u1"},{"quote":"distributors should not offer any gifts (other than a discount of fees or charges) in promoting a specific investment product or a particular type of investment product to a client.","unit_id":"u14"},{"quote":"such as certain types of funds or funds offered by certain fund houses","unit_id":"u14"},{"quote":"as they may be considered a gift that should not be offered to investors.","unit_id":"u13"}],"distinction":"For an intermediary within the circular’s distributor category, this reading also screens a promotion of an investment product outside SFC-authorised funds. The strongest uncertainty is whether the circular’s quotation supplies that broader application without the complete Code provision.","family":"scope","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor is an intermediary distributing SFC-authorised funds within the circular’s distributor category.","name":"is_distributor","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u1","u29"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed activity promotes a specific investment product or particular investment-product type to a client, including a substantively linked gift arrangement of the kind described in u14.","name":"has_product_promotion_link","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed promotion concerns SFC-authorised funds.","name":"promotes_authorised_funds","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u1","u13","u15"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed offer includes a benefit classified as a gift for the selected control, before applying the discount exception.","name":"offers_gift","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u13","u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Every gift component in the assessed offer qualifies as a discount of fees or charges; any non-discount gift component makes this false.","name":"all_gifts_are_fee_discounts","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(or (not offers_gift) all_gifts_are_fee_discounts)","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_distributor has_product_promotion_link)"},"local_id":"r1","questions":["Does paragraph 3.11’s full actor and product scope support extending this screen to the distributor’s other investment-product promotions?"],"statement":"Read the investment-product wording in paragraph 10 as stating a general gift-promotion control for the identified distributors: a gift linked to promotion of a specific investment product or product type to a client fails this selected control unless it is a discount of fees or charges. Neither structured-product classification nor proof of actual distraction is an additional trigger.","subject":"Selected paragraph-10 gift-promotion control with investment-product-wide scope"},"protocol":"legalmath.search.v1","repair_instruction":"Fix the contract/source-reference error using exact supplied units. Preserve source uncertainty and valid substantive alternatives; never fabricate citations.","repair_of_request_hash":"863e5d39b5d7a2dd147c68e7ed476885aeb3619970d78b6e04591eb7c98bf040","role":"adversarial-investigator","source_packet":{"authority":"RETAINED_SOURCE","dependencies":[{"dependency_id":"external-authorities.23ec46","source_hash":null}],"family_ids":["scope","definitions","exceptions","modality","time","dependencies"],"selected_slice":"Selected paragraph-10 gift-promotion control, its fee-discount exception and product/product-type connection. Retain surrounding provisions and footnotes as context and unresolved dependencies.","source_key":"sfc.23ec46.search","units":[{"locator":"Retained text line 1","normative":true,"span":{"end":495,"id":"s.u1","page":1,"quote_sha256":"442822b23173e6d22b345e0b971eda15bce33f0d1c452ec5421a39f69e59d410","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":2,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"This circular summarises the Securities and Futures Commission’s (SFC) recent observations of licensed corporations’ practices in offering and promoting SFC-authorised funds. Intermediaries who distribute these funds (distributors) have been offering additional returns or other incentives that may divert the client’s focus from properly considering the risks and features of the underlying funds. This circular also highlights the legal and regulatory requirements to be met by distributors.","unit_id":"u1"},{"locator":"Retained text line 2","normative":true,"span":{"end":507,"id":"s.u2","page":1,"quote_sha256":"ea2b8a878841df5955c78edc6cae47446483b86e3f5ccb04e1a8d940cf7e59fd","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":497,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Background","unit_id":"u2"},{"locator":"Retained text line 3","normative":true,"span":{"end":787,"id":"s.u3","page":1,"quote_sha256":"1af11939ea26428b3ebc908947bc9c1f16f0e153b769d724370e402bef46d880","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":512,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"In some cases, distributors promoted SFC-authorised funds (often via online platforms) and offered or imposed additional or distinct features or restrictions (eg, “guaranteed returns” or “lock-up periods”) beyond the product features set out in the funds’ offering documents.","unit_id":"u3"},{"locator":"Retained text line 4","normative":true,"span":{"end":1110,"id":"s.u4","page":1,"quote_sha256":"bb5d6d0066f0f3d1f31abecdaf338ffa59419754230c95ee338e84e9f9bf3161","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":792,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"In other cases, distributors asked clients to provide a mandate or standing instruction to invest in one or more SFC-authorised funds under specific circumstances, eg, using idle money in a client’s securities trading account with an aim to generate additional returns, albeit without any guaranteed or specific rates.","unit_id":"u4"},{"locator":"Retained text line 5","normative":true,"span":{"end":1265,"id":"s.u5","page":1,"quote_sha256":"8f21351a0ccdff701f2cc91871495aa1a1f6c2eb489975ea56821f8b71361cda","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":1115,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"These SFC-authorised funds and services were often promoted by the distributors to the public through aggressive and high-profile marketing campaigns.","unit_id":"u5"},{"locator":"Retained text line 6","normative":true,"span":{"end":1285,"id":"s.u6","page":1,"quote_sha256":"3502a56f7cfc1882bcea56240e2049ac086a6dd493f2f798572984a462255832","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":1267,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Guaranteed returns","unit_id":"u6"},{"locator":"Retained text line 7","normative":true,"span":{"end":1355,"id":"s.u7","page":1,"quote_sha256":"03c2ce4fec643340916926d6501ab8c112939a4757a21957ef88cb03e5d60fdb","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":1287,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Section 103 of the Securities and Futures Ordinance (Cap. 571) (SFO)","unit_id":"u7"},{"locator":"Retained text line 8","normative":true,"span":{"end":1646,"id":"s.u8","page":1,"quote_sha256":"94608f831bfe0bc9746af9dc0219689b16aafe90a74711539afe5f3d6f65302e","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":1360,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Typically, the “guaranteed returns” in such cases comprise: (i) the actual return of the relevant fund(s) invested by the investor (ie, fund return); and (ii) a top-up return to make up the difference between the fund return and the guaranteed rate of return offered by the distributor.","unit_id":"u8"},{"locator":"Retained text line 9","normative":true,"span":{"end":1935,"id":"s.u9","page":1,"quote_sha256":"c775d212de8b31011848e316ed775c7903d2a3439d14f1d0b43c68812f8f7fc6","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":1651,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"The SFC wishes to remind intermediaries who engage in promotional activities that these guaranteed return arrangements may constitute a \"structured product\" under the SFO if the return to investors is determined by reference to the change in value of any securities (including funds).","unit_id":"u9"},{"locator":"Retained text line 10","normative":true,"span":{"end":2234,"id":"s.u10","page":1,"quote_sha256":"da3d5056c84f1786f1d7407d2638edfe2d9c59c7c2bfab11e30f99901b252a22","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":1940,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"It is an offence under section 103 of the SFO for a person to issue an advertisement, invitation or document which is or contains an invitation to the Hong Kong public to enter into or offer to enter into any structured products, unless the SFC has authorised the issue or an exemption applies.","unit_id":"u10"},{"locator":"Retained text line 11","normative":true,"span":{"end":2601,"id":"s.u11","page":1,"quote_sha256":"b226a3d2cbdb1fed01e7c813e12644c991178112e7df12c5b5b06ada5cd3ff7e","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":2239,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"SFC-authorised funds without guaranteed features are required to highlight in their offering documents that they do not have these features and that investors may not get back the principal of their investment1. As such, any guaranteed returns provided by distributors may create a misleading impression that these returns are provided by the underlying fund(s).","unit_id":"u11"},{"locator":"Retained text line 12","normative":true,"span":{"end":2641,"id":"s.u12","page":1,"quote_sha256":"195534ad5daed52e7ac87063b4aecc79dc0bb389cebc88cc9215bac090ef2f22","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":2603,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Paragraph 3.11 of the Code of Conduct2","unit_id":"u12"},{"locator":"Retained text line 13","normative":true,"span":{"end":2982,"id":"s.u13","page":1,"quote_sha256":"04a87fceacdbfbba3d3538d0ac0f646499312578dd7b41272307ade3f323b691","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":2646,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Even where the guaranteed returns offered would not constitute a “structured product” under the SFO, distributors are reminded to have regard to paragraph 3.11 of the Code of Conduct in offering such returns or other incentives in promoting SFC-authorised funds, as they may be considered a gift that should not be offered to investors.","unit_id":"u13"},{"locator":"Retained text line 14","normative":true,"span":{"end":3670,"id":"s.u14","page":1,"quote_sha256":"2a189f82f8c81185ca622db5cbe25628a25b490bc2f08c8db57b0079dfef8654","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":2987,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Paragraph 3.11 of the Code of Conduct provides that distributors should not offer any gifts (other than a discount of fees or charges) in promoting a specific investment product or a particular type of investment product to a client. The purpose of the requirement is to avoid the use of gifts to distract investors from the features and risks of a particular product. If gifts are offered in such a way that they are linked to a particular type of investment product, such as certain types of funds or funds offered by certain fund houses, then such gifts will be bound by this requirement as investors may be distracted from the unique features and risks of such particular funds3.","unit_id":"u14"},{"locator":"Retained text line 15","normative":true,"span":{"end":4020,"id":"s.u15","page":1,"quote_sha256":"0fcee085b229ca8050a6fb6fdbc96da2f7a4dd33363295ece373b0fe323a3f89","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":3675,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"In light of the concerns set out from paragraphs 5 to 10 above, when offering or promoting funds, distributors should not offer additional returns (which are not part of the product features set out in the relevant offering documents) or other incentives to investors in breach of section 103 of the SFO or paragraph 3.11 of the Code of Conduct.","unit_id":"u15"},{"locator":"Retained text line 16","normative":true,"span":{"end":4058,"id":"s.u16","page":1,"quote_sha256":"dda918bbe82f30ddab28135039fbc339acf16acc07deb67f6babf9b2b2757743","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":4022,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Lock-up period and dealing frequency","unit_id":"u16"},{"locator":"Retained text line 17","normative":true,"span":{"end":4354,"id":"s.u17","page":1,"quote_sha256":"2f891b58037e676dcd695c3baf69a86f4853ed05e667c205c42107b8af4b853f","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":4063,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"When distributing SFC-authorised funds, some distributors imposed a lock-up period on their clients’ investments or lowered the funds’ dealing frequency. For instance, clients’ redemption was only allowed on a weekly or monthly basis even though the fund provided daily dealing arrangements.","unit_id":"u17"},{"locator":"Retained text line 18","normative":true,"span":{"end":4874,"id":"s.u18","page":1,"quote_sha256":"08297ac978b8b5eaf5dfc9048caf8c3b306c0cb224d151e2108633ea28bb7597","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":4359,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Distributors should act fairly and in the best interests of their clients in providing services in accordance with General Principle 1 (Honesty and fairness) of the Code of Conduct. They should not restrict a client’s right to redeem his or her investment in a fund pursuant to the dealing frequency specified in the fund’s offering documents. Such restrictions would limit the client’s ability to make effective and timely investment decisions in response to changing market conditions or individual circumstances.","unit_id":"u18"},{"locator":"Retained text line 19","normative":true,"span":{"end":5228,"id":"s.u19","page":1,"quote_sha256":"3d8087781b49ce535e15631e7265887d0afb4fbe07c78026ba6deb62cf847c20","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":4879,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"While distributors of SFC-authorised funds may have different fund dealing procedures or cut-off times for administrative efficiency, the SFC expects them to use their best endeavours to adhere to a fund’s dealing frequency as stipulated in its offering documents when dealing in the fund for clients, and not to reduce the fund’s dealing frequency.","unit_id":"u19"},{"locator":"Retained text line 20","normative":true,"span":{"end":5252,"id":"s.u20","page":1,"quote_sha256":"7e1dfa66af384d4b087a94fecfb2cecfa563dd744d656ea862ae5f640932f566","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":5230,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Other marketing issues","unit_id":"u20"},{"locator":"Retained text line 21","normative":true,"span":{"end":5898,"id":"s.u21","page":1,"quote_sha256":"994420732f7ffb764258e7b4c4c102643e363748d0214053741f033cbfb141eb","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":5257,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"In some cases, distributors offered or marketed the services described in paragraph 3 above without any guaranteed rates of return, but highlighted the regular interest payments or distribution features of the services prominently (eg, interest generated daily, or clients’ potential financial return from using such services), which would in fact be derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying fund(s). In preparing invitations and advertisements to promote their services, intermediaries should ensure that they do not contain any misleading or deceptive information, and they must comply with paragraph 2.3 of the Code of Conduct.","unit_id":"u21"},{"locator":"Retained text line 22","normative":true,"span":{"end":6369,"id":"s.u22","page":1,"quote_sha256":"bc704754c5b7c9c59e6a6b494dd6f9505f930ae4b36a37aa02d6368c69a4edf2","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":5903,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Where a distributor highlights in an advertisement the financial return of its services, which is in fact derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying SFC-authorised fund(s), the advertisement, particularly the presentation of financial return relating to the services, should be prepared in a manner that is consistent with the principles under the SFC’s Advertising Guidelines Applicable to Collective Investment Schemes Authorized under the Product Codes4.","unit_id":"u22"},{"locator":"Retained text line 23","normative":true,"span":{"end":7002,"id":"s.u23","page":1,"quote_sha256":"20ecbac168ce1f7902c8b60784189a57017881fb8408fea1d9d3bd707bea3b74","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":6374,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Specifically, the advertisements of these services should avoid giving a misleading impression that the relevant services or underlying fund(s) would generate positive or guaranteed returns without any risk of loss. In addition, the advertisements should not draw a parallel between the services and the placement of cash on deposits, imply they are deposit-like arrangements (including any comparisons between the financial returns of the services and bank deposit rates), or suggest that the services are, or are equivalent to, bank deposits or savings (eg, by emphasising the services can address investors’ “savings needs”).","unit_id":"u23"},{"locator":"Retained text line 24","normative":true,"span":{"end":7178,"id":"s.u24","page":1,"quote_sha256":"b9db4855c8d4944ebdfe0009a08ee4d1623c21e673c1c221a04b1bab3f6497ec","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":7007,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"The SFC will closely monitor market practices concerning the promotion of SFC-authorised funds and may take regulatory action and issue further guidance where appropriate.","unit_id":"u24"},{"locator":"Retained text line 25","normative":true,"span":{"end":7274,"id":"s.u25","page":1,"quote_sha256":"0e3225addfcc2663ed547268443c0eda4c4b22cc50e1f858008119256b3a532c","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":7186,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Intermediaries Supervision Department                       Investment Products Division","unit_id":"u25"},{"locator":"Retained text line 26","normative":true,"span":{"end":7392,"id":"s.u26","page":1,"quote_sha256":"65ef453c883837716ab8837d02d9559715cd243baf93ca1a5cf70be2d67b8492","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":7275,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Intermediaries Division                                                             Securities and Futures Commission","unit_id":"u26"},{"locator":"Retained text line 27","normative":true,"span":{"end":7426,"id":"s.u27","page":1,"quote_sha256":"88e2bc94e9edc39f2ac1cdaaea86b44ab5ea59b31c446f69591f21bf460b005e","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":7393,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"Securities and Futures Commission","unit_id":"u27"},{"locator":"Retained text line 28","normative":true,"span":{"end":7985,"id":"s.u28","page":1,"quote_sha256":"bf5f8b77f3976a352737ec8fbcfd51cec4ddf8c7ebfa8bcec39b200cf36f6a6c","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":7511,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"1 Pursuant to 6.4 of the Overarching Principles Section as set out in the SFC Handbook for Unit Trusts and Mutual Funds, Investment-Linked Assurance Schemes and Unlisted Structured Investment Products, offering documents of an SFC-authorised fund shall contain the information necessary for investors to be able to make an informed judgement of the investment whilst all key features and risks of the fund shall be highlighted prominently in a succinct manner for investors.","unit_id":"u28"},{"locator":"Retained text line 29","normative":true,"span":{"end":8108,"id":"s.u29","page":1,"quote_sha256":"4c6f6c26a269f1395844e4e68ad8b7b0dc9a752bf58521543258b9ca6360144b","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":7987,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"2 The Code of Conduct for Persons Licensed by or Registered with the Securities and Futures Commission (Code of Conduct).","unit_id":"u29"},{"locator":"Retained text line 30","normative":true,"span":{"end":8233,"id":"s.u30","page":1,"quote_sha256":"7d1b57b24a3d3a602b7413d75e6e6c8469cf4f2366245996989f8837b9944ce3","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":8110,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"3 The answer to question 1 of the frequently asked questions on the Code of Conduct issued by the SFC on 30 September 2010.","unit_id":"u30"},{"locator":"Retained text line 31","normative":true,"span":{"end":8342,"id":"s.u31","page":1,"quote_sha256":"7d11e9adab289c660270ea1d9d1de8ece380656044c134d8dcd9eaaedd938b50","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":8235,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},"text":"4 As supplemented by the frequently asked questions and other guidance issued by the SFC from time to time.","unit_id":"u31"}]},"task":"REPAIR_OUTPUT","validation_details":"Quote absent or ambiguous within ret